      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the sentences, using the words in the box. You may need to change the form of the words.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.03%; height: 18.3333px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"10\" cellpadding=\"10\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 18.3333px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 19.9969%; height: 18.3333px; text-align: center;\"><strong>property</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9969%; height: 18.3333px; text-align: center;\"><strong>whistle</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9969%; height: 18.3333px; text-align: center;\"><strong>warn</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9969%; height: 18.3333px; text-align: center;\"><strong>bookcase</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9969%; height: 18.3333px; text-align: center;\"><strong>share</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br>1. The earthquake made that <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.1</label><input id='fbo-901688-0' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='0' name='fbo-901688-0' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901688-0' /></span></strong> fall, and all the books dropped to the floor.</p>\n<p>2. The flood damaged many houses, and people lost their <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.2</label><input id='fbo-901688-1' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='1' name='fbo-901688-1' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901688-1' /></span></strong>, including furniture and clothes.</p>\n<p>3. After the disaster, people <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.3</label><input id='fbo-901688-2' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='2' name='fbo-901688-2' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901688-2' /></span></strong> their stories about how they survived the dangerous event.</p>\n<p>4. The rescue worker began to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.4</label><input id='fbo-901688-3' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='3' name='fbo-901688-3' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901688-3' /></span></strong> loudly to get the attention of the team.</p>\n<p>5. The weather forecast <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.5</label><input id='fbo-901688-4' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='4' name='fbo-901688-4' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901688-4' /></span></strong> that a strong storm will hit the coast within the next few hours.</p>",
