      "explanation": "<p>Từ loại c&acirc;̀n đi&ecirc;̀n: trạng từ, theo sau và b&ocirc;̉ sung ý nghĩa cho đ&ocirc;̣ng từ \"<strong>shaking</strong>\".</p>\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 523px;\"><iframe id=\"48800D23\" src=\"https://azvocab.ai/embed/SL?params=U2FsdGVkX19SNfZedGFKLcllR3RYqdfv5Vb5jqxk%2FOLiYecYQ5bn2%2FdTyX5jmtbpsGsoIq6dj28MozBy299wl3LFQDVFYJhbKYvTGvB%2FFOZwOJPKjHDtjpQOQE3h63LnXrSO%2F7KEqrSFpns2Ggr8OR9fC%2BqmLFzvJilJ8Gicg3EycXgYHcq1npGmWM9jGW9xLcGpX5Ei1UTDMiFERPFvASwFGO%2B%2Bhwi6v2%2BptoTvWXayrzS4nAUS5GGoiAPEjFF5a%2F2JQdMROd9FpWL6olsDzD6q%2FSuzGdWU%2BLOPGAreDq%2Fvk0DbDiy1IMAtcy5IDd5y\" width=\"100%\" height=\"180\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></div>\n<p>Dịch: Mặt đất đột nhi&ecirc;n rung chuyển, mọi người chạy ra ngo&agrave;i để t&igrave;m nơi an to&agrave;n.</p>",
