      "questionText": "<p><em>Complete the sentence by changing the form of the word in capitals.</em></p>\n<p><span class='fillblank-option'><input id='fbo-901699-0' class='ms fillblank-option-4' index='0' name='fbo-901699-0' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901699-0' /></span>, the storm ended before it caused serious damage to the town and people. (LUCK)</strong></p>",
