          ]
        }
      ],
      "shortAnswers": null,
      "hint": "",
      "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"eq-highlight\">Từ loại cần điền:</span> <strong>trạng từ</strong>, từ cần điền đứng ở đầu câu, bổ nghĩa cho cả mệnh đề sau đó, diễn tả một cách may mắn hay không may mắn về sự việc được nhắc đến.</p>\n<style>\n    .vocab-table-sharp-wrapper {\n        width: 100%;\n        background-color: #ffffff; \n        border: 1px solid #ceedca;\n        border-radius: 10px; \n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-table-sharp {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-table-sharp td {\n        padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem;\n        color: #1c581f;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #ceedca;\n        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        vertical-align: top; \n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    \n    .vocab-table-sharp td:first-child {\n        border-right: 1px solid #ceedca;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-table-sharp tr:last-child td {\n        border-bottom: none;\n    }\n\n    .word-en-sharp {\n        margin-right: 0.4rem;\n        font-size: 14px; \n    }\n\n    .word-pos-sharp {\n        color: #5fbd18; \n        margin-right: 0.4rem;\n    }\n    \n    .word-pron-sharp {\n        color: #333333;\n    }\n\n    .example-sharp {\n        margin-top: 6px;\n        color: #555555;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .eq-highlight {\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n\n    .meaning-en-sharp {\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n        color: #222222;\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"vocab-table-sharp-wrapper\">\n<table class=\"vocab-table-sharp\" style=\"height: 106px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 106px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 347.6px; height: 106px;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">luck</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(n.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/lʌk/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">I had the good <span class=\"eq-highlight\">luck</span> to meet her.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 347.6px; height: 106px;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">success or good things that happen to you by chance</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>sự may mắn</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 106px; background-color: #e5f6e3;\">\n<td style=\"width: 347.6px; height: 106px;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">luckily</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adv.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ˈlʌkɪli/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\"><span class=\"eq-highlight\">Luckily</span>, no one was hurt in the accident.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 347.6px; height: 106px;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">by good luck; fortunately</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>may mắn thay</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<details style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #5fbd18; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 0;\">Xem thêm các từ cùng gốc khác</summary>\n<div class=\"vocab-table-sharp-wrapper\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n<table class=\"vocab-table-sharp\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">lucky</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adj.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ˈlʌki/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">You're <span class=\"eq-highlight\">lucky</span> to have such good friends.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">having good things happen to you by chance</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>may mắn</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">unlucky</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adj.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ʌnˈlʌki/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">He was <span class=\"eq-highlight\">unlucky</span> to lose in the final.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">having bad luck</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>không may mắn</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">unluckily</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adv.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ʌnˈlʌkɪli/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\"><span class=\"eq-highlight\">Unluckily</span>, it started to rain just as we left.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">by bad luck; unfortunately</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>không may mắn thay</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">luckless</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adj.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ˈlʌkləs/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">The <span class=\"eq-highlight\">luckless</span> team lost another game.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">having no luck</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>kém may mắn</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</details>",
