      "questionName": "victim, affect, donate",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Reorder the letters to make complete words. The first letters are underlined.</strong></p>\n<p>Anna: Hi, Tom. Did you hear about the flood in the nearby town?</p>\n<p>Tom: Yes, it was awful. Many people became <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-901708-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-901708-0' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901708-0' /></span> (I-T-I-C-M-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">V</span>-S)</strong> and lost their homes.</p>\n<p>Anna: I heard the flood damaged a lot of <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-901708-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-901708-1' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901708-1' /></span> (O-E-R-R-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">P</span>-P-Y-T)</strong>, like houses and shops.</p>\n<p>Tom: That&#8217;s true. It will <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-901708-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-901708-2' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901708-2' /></span> (F-C-F-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">A</span>-T-E)</strong> their lives for a long time.</p>\n<p>Anna: Are they asking for help? I would like to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-901708-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-901708-3' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901708-3' /></span> (N-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">D</span>-E-T-O-A)</strong> clothes and some money.</p>\n<p>Tom: Yes, they are. You can do that through the local charity or the town hall.</p>\n<p>Anna: That&#8217;s great. I hope everyone gets the support they need.</p>\n<p>Tom: Me too, Anna. Disasters like this are so difficult for families.</p>",
