      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Read the following passage and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Natural disasters can strike <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-901722-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-901722-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901722-0'></option><option value=\"leisurely\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-0-leisurely'>leisurely</option><option value=\"normally\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-0-normally'>normally</option><option value=\"suddenly\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-0-suddenly'>suddenly</option><option value=\"luckily\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-0-luckily'>luckily</option></select></span></strong>, which leaves people unprepared. When a disaster happens, it is important to stay calm and follow the warnings from the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-901722-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-901722-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901722-1'></option><option value=\"dentist\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-1-dentist'>dentist</option><option value=\"headmaster\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-1-headmaster'>headmaster</option><option value=\"partner\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-1-partner'>partner</option><option value=\"authority\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-1-authority'>authority</option></select></span> </strong>of the city. During a disaster, extreme weather conditions can cause floods, landslides, etc. Therefore, people should keep an emergency kit with essential supplies, such as food, water, and first aid items, ready to use. When a disaster affects a large area, many people will become <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-901722-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-901722-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901722-2'></option><option value=\"customers\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-2-customers'>customers</option><option value=\"competitors\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-2-competitors'>competitors</option><option value=\"volunteers\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-2-volunteers'>volunteers</option><option value=\"victims\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-2-victims'>victims</option></select></span></strong> and need help. Many charities and individuals often share resources and <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-901722-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-901722-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901722-3'></option><option value=\"exchange\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-3-exchange'>exchange</option><option value=\"donate\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-3-donate'>donate</option><option value=\"waste\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-3-waste'>waste</option><option value=\"remove\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-3-remove'>remove</option></select></span></strong> to those in need. Despite the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.5</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='4' name='fbo-901722-4' data-testid='fillblank-select-901722-4'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901722-4'></option><option value=\"awful\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-4-awful'>awful</option><option value=\"happy\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-4-happy'>happy</option><option value=\"useful\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-4-useful'>useful</option><option value=\"optimistic\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901722-4-optimistic'>optimistic</option></select></span></strong> situation, we can rebuild and support each other during these difficult times by working together.</p>",
